1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:10,500
Lateral surface area and total surface area of cube.

2
00:00:11,120 --> 00:00:22,320
Lateral surface area of cube equals area of one face times 4.

3
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:38,470
Total surface area of cube equals area of one face times 6.

4
00:00:41,020 --> 00:01:02,850
Example: Calculate lateral surface area and total surface area of cube with side 5 cm.

5
00:01:04,420 --> 00:01:08,600
Lateral surface area of that cube is:

6
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:21,170
(5 x 5) x 4 = 100 (cm<sup>2</sup>)

7
00:01:21,170 --> 00:01:27,170
Total surface area of that cube is:

8
00:01:27,170 --> 00:01:42,720
(5 x 5) x 6 = 150 (cm<sup>2</sup>)

